    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Fixed the shared property type rail. Hovering the property and focusing its input now use the same outward slide. Left-column rails keep an internal gutter, so labels such as INT are no longer cut off; the min/max popup opens inward. FF8 numeric text controls now identify themselves as INT or FLOAT from their actual constraints instead of falling back to STRING. The rendered Blank, FF8, and RDR2 checks pass.",
